-#: ../misc-utils/findmnt.8.adoc:181
-#, no-wrap
-msgid "*--tree*"
-msgstr ""
-
-#. type: Plain text
-#: ../misc-utils/findmnt.8.adoc:183
-msgid ""
-"Enable tree-like output if possible. The options is silently ignored for "
-"tables where is missing child-parent relation (e.g., _fstab_)."
