-msgstr "Zobrazí verzi a skončí."
-
-#. type: Plain text
-#: ../misc-utils/lastlog2.8.adoc:75
-msgid ""
-"If the user has never logged in the message **Never logged in** will be "
-"displayed in the latest login time row."
