-msgstr "*-f*, *--fast*"
-
-#. type: Plain text
-#: ../sys-utils/dmesg.1.adoc:77
-msgid ""
-"Read the /dev/kmsg messages from the given _file_. Different record as "
-"expected to be separated by a NULL byte."
-msgstr ""
-
-#. type: Labeled list
-#: ../sys-utils/dmesg.1.adoc:78
