-
-#. type: Plain text
-#: ../sys-utils/lscpu.1.adoc:48
-msgid ""
-"When specifying the _list_ argument, the string of option, equal sign (=), "
-"and _list_ must not contain any blanks or other whitespace. Examples: *-"
-"C=NAME,ONE-SIZE* or *--caches=NAME,ONE-SIZE*."
