-
-#. type: Plain text
-#: ../sys-utils/blkpr.8.adoc:29
-msgid ""
-"The command for managing persistent reservations. Supported commands are: "
-"*register*, *reserve*, *release*, *preempt*, *preempt-abort*, and *clear*."
