-"Create a POSIX shared memory segment of _size_ bytes. The _size_ argument "
-"may be followed by the multiplicative suffixes KiB (=1024), MiB "
-"(=1024*1024), and so on for GiB, etc. (the \"iB\" is optional, e.g., \"K\" "
