-"Display the specified _type_ of namespaces only. The supported types are "
-"*mnt*, *net*, *ipc*, *user*, *pid*, *uts*, *cgroup* and *time*. This option "
-"may be given more than once."
-msgstr ""
-
-#. type: Labeled list
-#: ../sys-utils/lsns.8.adoc:80
-#, no-wrap
-msgid "*-W*, *--nowrap*"
