-"This manual page was written by mailto:linux@youmustbejoking.demon.co."
-"uk[Darren Salt] for the Debian project (and may be used by others)."
-msgstr ""
-
-#. type: Plain text
-#: ../sys-utils/rfkill.8.adoc:83
