-#~ msgid ""
-#~ "If the filesystem was changed, i.e., repaired, then B<fsck.minix> will "
-#~ "print \"FILE SYSTEM HAS CHANGED\" and will B<sync>(2)  three times before "
-#~ "exiting.  There is I<no> need to reboot after check."
