-#~ "interrupt-driven printing should be somewhat faster and efficient, and "
-#~ "will probably be desirable."
-#~ msgstr ""
-#~ "-i I<E<lt>IRQE<gt>> es la línea de interrupciones o IRQ a emplear para el "
