-"ou « *--caches=NOM,UNE-TAILLE* »."
-
-#. type: Plain text
-#: ../sys-utils/lscpu.1.adoc:50
-#, fuzzy
-#| msgid ""
-#| "The default list of columns may be extended if _list_ is specified in the "
