-msgid ""
-"For other details see the *mkudffs*(8) 2.0+ manpage, see the *COMPATIBILITY* "
-"and *BLOCK SIZE* sections."
-msgstr ""
-"Pour plus de détails, consultez le manuel de *mkudffs*(8), version 2.0+, "
-"sections *COMPATIBILITY* et *BLOCK SIZE*."
