-msgid ""
-"For filesystems created by NeXTStep (on NeXT station) (currently read only)."
-msgstr ""
-"Pour les systèmes de fichiers créés par NeXTStep (station NeXT) (lecture "
-"seule actuellement)."
-
-#. type: Labeled list
-#: ../sys-utils/mount.8.adoc:1498
-#, no-wrap
-msgid "*nextstep-cd*"
-msgstr "*nextstep-cd*"
-
-#. type: delimited block _
