-#~ msgid ""
-#~ "For ordinary mounts, it will hold (a link to) a block special device node "
-#~ "(as created by B<mknod>(2)) for the device to be mounted, like I</dev/"
-#~ "cdrom> or I</dev/sdb7>. For NFS mounts, this field is I<E<lt>hostE<gt>:"
