-#~ msgid ""
-#~ "The B<nsenter> command executes I<program> in the namespace(s) that are "
-#~ "specified in the command-line options (described below).  If I<program> "
-#~ "is not given, then ``${SHELL}'' is run (default: /bin\\:/sh)."
