-"mailto:dave@gnu.org[Davidlohr Bueso], mailto:kzak@redhat.com[Karel Zak]"
-
-#. type: Plain text
-#: ../disk-utils/partx.8.adoc:134
-msgid ""
-"The original version was written by mailto:aeb@cwi.nl[Andries E. Brouwer]"
