-#. type: Plain text
-#: ../sys-utils/ldattach.8.adoc:90
-msgid ""
-"Keep *ldattach* in the foreground so that it can be interrupted or debugged, "
-"and to print verbose messages about its progress to standard error output."
-msgstr ""
