-
-#. type: Labeled list
-#: ../sys-utils/unshare.1.adoc:278
-#, no-wrap
-msgid "``OCF``"
-msgstr ""
-
-#. type: Plain text
-#: ../sys-utils/unshare.1.adoc:279
-msgid ""
-"the file is open by the kernel with credential and security tokens of the "
-"file itself and loaded as soon as we register it."
