-msgid "*--blink* **on**|**off**"
-msgstr "*--blink* on|off"
-
-#. type: Plain text
-#: ../term-utils/setterm.1.adoc:70
-msgid ""
-"Turns blink mode on or off. Except on a virtual console, *--blink off* turns "
-"off all attributes (bold, half-brightness, blink, reverse)."
-msgstr ""
