-"Enable display of unknown usernames when login failures are recorded. The "
-"default value is _no_."
-msgstr ""
-
-#. type: Plain text
-#: ../login-utils/login.1.adoc:131
-msgid ""
-"Note that logging unknown usernames may be a security issue if a user enters "
