-
-#. type: Plain text
-#: ../login-utils/sulogin.8.adoc:63
-msgid ""
-"Specify the maximum amount of time to wait for user input. By default, "
-"*sulogin* will wait forever."
-msgstr ""
-
-#. type: Plain text
-#: ../login-utils/sulogin.8.adoc:69
-msgid ""
