-"Print paths as terminal hyperlinks. The _mode_ can be set to \"always\", "
-"\"never\", or \"auto\". The optional argument _when_ can be set to \"auto\", "
-"\"never\", or \"always\". If the _when_ argument is omitted, it will default "
