-
-#. type: Plain text
-#: ../misc-utils/hardlink.1.adoc:85
-msgid ""
-"Link and compare files even if their owner information (user and group) "
-"differs. Results may be unpredictable."
-msgstr ""
-
-#. type: Labeled list
-#: ../misc-utils/hardlink.1.adoc:86
-#, fuzzy, no-wrap
-msgid "*-O*, *--keep-oldest*"
