-"KiB=1024, MiB=1024*1024, and so on for GiB, TiB, PiB, EiB, ZiB and YiB (the "
-"\"iB\" is optional, e.g., \"K\" has the same meaning as \"KiB\") or the "
-"suffixes KB=1000, MB=1000*1000, and so on for GB, TB, PB, EB, ZB and YB."
-msgstr ""
