-
-#. type: Plain text
-#: ../schedutils/chrt.1.adoc:75
-msgid ""
-"Specifies period parameter for *SCHED_DEADLINE* policy (Linux-specific). "
-"Note that the kernel's lower limit is 100 milliseconds."
-msgstr ""
-
-#. type: Labeled list
-#: ../schedutils/chrt.1.adoc:76
-#, fuzzy, no-wrap
