-#, fuzzy, no-wrap
-msgid "**codepage=**__value__"
-msgstr "VALOR DE RETORNO"
-
-#. type: Plain text
-#: ../sys-utils/mount.8.adoc:964
-msgid ""
-"Sets the codepage for converting to shortname characters on FAT and VFAT "
-"filesystems. By default, codepage 437 is used."
