-
-#. type: delimited block _
-#: ../sys-utils/mount.8.adoc:1351
-msgid ""
-"UBIFS is a flash filesystem which works on top of UBI volumes. Note that "
-"*atime* is not supported and is always turned off."
-msgstr ""
-
