-
-#. type: Plain text
-#: ../sys-utils/nsenter.1.adoc:28 ../sys-utils/unshare.1.adoc:34
-msgid ""
-"Setting hostname or domainname will not affect the rest of the system. For "
-"further details, see *uts_namespaces*(7)."
-msgstr ""
