-
-#. type: Plain text
-#: ../sys-utils/swapon.8.adoc:120
-msgid ""
-"The command *swapoff --all* returns 0 (all succeeded), 32 (all failed), or "
-"64 (some failed, some succeeded)."
-msgstr ""
-
-#. type: Plain text
-#: ../sys-utils/swapon.8.adoc:122
