-"                              especificado por -t\n"
-
-#. type: Plain text
-#: ../text-utils/more.1.adoc:70
-msgid ""
-"Exit on End-Of-File, enabled by default if POSIXLY_CORRECT environment "
-"variable is not set or if not executed on terminal."
