-#: ../disk-utils/cfdisk.8.adoc:147
-msgid ""
-"The current *cfdisk* implementation is based on the original *cfdisk* from "
-"mailto:martin@cs.unc.edu[Kevin E. Martin]."
-msgstr ""
-
