-#. type: Plain text
-#: ../lsfd-cmd/lsfd.1.adoc:560
-msgid ""
-"Well-known CIDs will be decoded: \"`{asterisk}`\", \"`hypervisor`\", "
-"\"`local`\", or \"`host`\".  Well-known ports will be decoded: "
-"\"`{asterisk}`\"."
-msgstr ""
-
